   = note: a primitive float needs nothing; any other type is opted in by putting `#[reassoc::passthrough]` on its `impl` of the marked trait, which needs the type to have all five operators (`+ - * / %` and their `op=` forms), `Sum` and `Product` by value and by reference, and a `powi(self, i32) -> Self` method
